WEBVTT

00:17:58.917 --> 00:18:02.999
and we reinvented the whole way
humanity thinks about changing things,

00:18:03.023 --> 00:18:06.499
forever, for everyone --

00:18:06.523 --> 00:18:10.317
well, I thought I would let
the kids sum up what that would be.

00:18:11.301 --> 00:18:13.152
Annalisa Smith-Pallotta: That would be

00:18:13.176 --> 00:18:15.158
Sage Smith-Pallotta: a real social

00:18:15.182 --> 00:18:17.008
Rider Smith-Pallotta: innovation.

00:18:17.428 --> 00:18:19.079
Dan Pallotta: Thank you very much.

00:18:19.103 --> 00:18:20.358
Thank you.

00:18:20.382 --> 00:18:27.329
(Applause)

00:18:29.518 --> 00:18:30.691
Thank you.